                        <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:89%;">1:</span></span>
                        
                        
                       train the AR-diffusion model <math id="alg3.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Psi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Ψ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Psi</annotation></semantics></math> with <a href="#alg2" title="In 3.3 Initialization of Generator and Guidance Network ‣ 3 Distilled Decoding 2 ‣ Distilled Decoding 2: One-step Sampling of Image Auto-regressive Models with Conditional Score Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Alg.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>

